WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.358
Your book is not the business.

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:04.480
Your book is the hook.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:09.098
Authors Bureau turns one book into twenty eight revenue streams.

00:00:09.198 --> 00:00:12.420
The streams are grouped into three packages.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:18.214
Brand helps you grow your audience, with email marketing, lead magnets and your author website.

00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:24.392
Build turns your book into products, such as workbooks, home study courses and audiobooks.

00:00:24.492 --> 00:00:30.090
Yield covers high value offers, like speaking, coaching and certification.

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.292
Every stream follows the same four steps.

00:00:33.392 --> 00:00:35.798
First, set up its structure.

00:00:35.898 --> 00:00:38.952
Then ABBY drafts the content from your book.

00:00:39.052 --> 00:00:42.754
Next, review and edit it in your own words.

00:00:42.854 --> 00:00:45.716
Finally, pass the readiness check.

00:00:45.816 --> 00:00:48.342
You can change any text directly.

00:00:48.442 --> 00:00:53.920
Editing keeps your approved copy, so nothing is regenerated unless you ask.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:58.274
When all the required items are ready, publish the stream.

00:00:58.374 --> 00:01:03.468
Its page then appears on your author site, under your name and the right book title.

00:01:03.568 --> 00:01:05.590
Authors Bureau.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.808
Your Story is Your LIFE.
